# DigiCampus agent rules

- Read `CONTEXT.md` and `AGENTS.md` before changing behavior.
- Release truth: `implementation-status.md`.
- All CLI `--json` output must include `schemaVersion: "1"`.
- Errors use `DigicampusError` with `code`, `message`, `hint`.
- SDK has no Commander imports; CLI has no raw fetch — use `digicampus-sdk`.
- MCP tools are defined in `packages/mcp/src/tools.ts`.
- Extraction lives in `packages/sdk/src/extract.ts` — external tools (poppler/LibreOffice) are optional; every kind must degrade gracefully with a `hint`. Never add heavy npm deps for parsing (no pdfjs, no mammoth); shell out or use native XML.
- Run `pnpm validate` before proposing ship.
- Auth uses OAuth when registered; the local helper is only a temporary fallback. Do not add browser process control for login.
- Exam dates from achievement text are `confirmed: false` — preserve that semantics.
- Slide answers require visual inspection: agents must read `pageImages` or `viewerFileUrl` (see `digicampus-visual` skill). Never ship slide summaries from `content.md` text only.
- `viewer.html` is generated on read/view only — not during bulk extract (keep sync fast).
